          "ActivityPersuitPurposesDescription": "Activity during the financial year included receiving donations, evaluating conservation projects in Africa, Asia and South America, establishing fundraising and administrative systems and developing a strategy for future activities. Due diligence and technical review of potential projects and partners was undertaken. Project agreements were signed and support provided to four projects: (1) the translocation of Sable and Roan antelope and other species to Matusadona National Park in Zimbabwe (with African Parks); (2) the acquisition of land in Ecuador (with Jocotoco Foundation); (3) biological surveys for the White-bellied Heron in Bhutan (with the Royal Society for the Protection of Nature, Bhutan); (4) forest conservation in Papua (Indonesia).",
